WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.912
Hello everybody my name is Markiplier and welcome to Dungeon Nightmares.

00:00:03.936 --> 00:00:08.776
A randomly generated indie horror game that is supposedly excessively scary.

00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:10.018
So let's get into it.

00:00:10.120 --> 00:00:13.000
"Keep moving, they know where you are."

00:00:13.133 --> 00:00:15.563
Whose they, do they need to know where I am?

00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:17.934
Am I an important person in this venture?

00:00:18.026 --> 00:00:20.456
That's what I need to know and now. Ok.

00:00:20.814 --> 00:00:24.299
It is dark, I don't have a flashlight but that says "Press C to use."

00:00:24.299 --> 00:00:27.654
And now it says "Press B to blow." Really?

00:00:27.654 --> 00:00:31.251
Well, if only life was that easy but we can't always get what we want, you know?

00:00:32.751 --> 00:00:34.616
"Help. Me."

00:00:34.616 --> 00:00:38.075
It looked like I got kind of a piece of paper, what the hell did I get?

00:00:38.075 --> 00:00:44.270
Who the hell am I helping? I'll help ya, and I gotta do is press B to blow if that helps you in any way.

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:45.262
That's my one true -

00:00:46.352 --> 00:00:50.564
Oh, what is this, Vanish? Don't blow steam in my face.

00:00:50.564 --> 00:00:56.657
Ok, I got a map here. Ok, well that's nice. At least it shows me exactly where I went.

00:00:56.657 --> 00:01:01.771
This candle doesn't do jack doodly squat! I can't - oh.

00:01:01.771 --> 00:01:04.422
Ah, whatever. It was nothing.

00:01:04.422 --> 00:01:06.646
Ok, I got the volume way turned way up in my headphones

00:01:06.646 --> 00:01:11.528
and I got my pants way turned down on my legs, I guess, if that made any sense.

00:01:11.528 --> 00:01:15.633
And I'm ready to go. Come on, bring on the scares.

00:01:15.633 --> 00:01:18.268
What is that? Oh, that's a fly?

00:01:18.268 --> 00:01:23.028
Is it a fly that's gonna buzz and burrow into my ear like in that other game that I just played?

00:01:23.028 --> 00:01:25.869
