00:01:25.869 --> 00:01:32.006
K, I hear flies. Why would there be flies unless there were dead bodies just rotting openly in the floor?

00:01:32.006 --> 00:01:35.627
Which there probably will be. Just sayin'.

00:01:35.627 --> 00:01:37.575
Just super saiyan.

00:01:37.575 --> 00:01:40.546
Ok, this is a dead end but I'm gonna explore everything.

00:01:40.546 --> 00:01:45.424
This reminds me a lot of Dreadhalls and I apologize, my voice is a little raspy toda -

00:01:45.424 --> 00:01:49.411
