00:16:14.068 --> 00:16:18.313
Hmm, alright, ok. I'll do it this way, 'cause it's been - I've been playing for about 17 minutes,

00:16:18.313 --> 00:16:20.275
there's no way I'm gonna get through all 7.

00:16:20.275 --> 00:16:23.842
